{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/WhatIsNFAWTitle.png?t=1747275549\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate monster taming game for players who\u2019d rather battle and try interesting team line-ups than grind levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is an opportunity to try new monsters and combos, and takes approximately 45min-1h to complete. Completing a run also unlocks a random monster as a starter option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/ChooseYourStarterBanner.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run begins by choosing a monster (every monster can be unlocked as a potential starter). From there you\u2019ll encounter tombstones with monsters to reanimate and add to your roster, so you can craft the ideal 2-monster team to battle with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/ChooseYourStarterGIF.gif?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choosing a starter helps alleviate the randomness between runs, ensuring you always have a monster you enjoying playing with. And there\u2019s always the random option for those who enjoy the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/TakeMultipleActionsEachTurnTitle.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start each turn with 3 Action Points (AP). Every Move has a cost, and you can use Moves from either monster on your team \u2013 or both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain together multiple Moves to unleash powerful combos and devastate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/MultipleActionsPerTurn.gif?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/GetBackToTheCitadelBanner.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each night\u2019s main objective is to return to the Necromancer\u2019s Citadel in the middle of the map. Along the way you\u2019ll encounter more monsters to reanimate, powerful move tomes and passives, and unique enemies to face.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/UnlockMonstersBanner.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some monsters won\u2019t appear in a run until you unlock them by completing certain challenges, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using the same move 5 times in a turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dealing 100 Damage with a single Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using at least 5 different Monster Team combinations in a single run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win a battle without using any Offensive Moves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And many more!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2987110?t=1747275549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/08d5a369da00009f0497c32f661d75d667823d99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747275549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747275549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747275549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/WhatIsNFAWTitle.png?t=1747275549\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ultimate monster taming game for players who\u2019d rather battle and try interesting team line-ups than grind levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is an opportunity to try new monsters and combos, and takes approximately 45min-1h to complete. Completing a run also unlocks a random monster as a starter option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/ChooseYourStarterBanner.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run begins by choosing a monster (every monster can be unlocked as a potential starter). From there you\u2019ll encounter tombstones with monsters to reanimate and add to your roster, so you can craft the ideal 2-monster team to battle with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/ChooseYourStarterGIF.gif?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choosing a starter helps alleviate the randomness between runs, ensuring you always have a monster you enjoying playing with. And there\u2019s always the random option for those who enjoy the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/TakeMultipleActionsEachTurnTitle.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start each turn with 3 Action Points (AP). Every Move has a cost, and you can use Moves from either monster on your team \u2013 or both!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain together multiple Moves to unleash powerful combos and devastate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/MultipleActionsPerTurn.gif?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/GetBackToTheCitadelBanner.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each night\u2019s main objective is to return to the Necromancer\u2019s Citadel in the middle of the map. Along the way you\u2019ll encounter more monsters to reanimate, powerful move tomes and passives, and unique enemies to face.<br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/extras/UnlockMonstersBanner.png?t=1747275549\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some monsters won\u2019t appear in a run until you unlock them by completing certain challenges, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using the same move 5 times in a turn</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dealing 100 Damage with a single Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using at least 5 different Monster Team combinations in a single run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win a battle without using any Offensive Moves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And many more!</p>","developers":["QuietPenguinGaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/header.jpg?t=1747275549","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Necromancer For A Week","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256mb Video Memory, capable of OpenGL 2.0+ support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["QuietPenguinGaming"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"June 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/e794570e39cb780a951dffce3bc447d9084f9b96/ss_e794570e39cb780a951dffce3bc447d9084f9b96.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747275549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/e794570e39cb780a951dffce3bc447d9084f9b96/ss_e794570e39cb780a951dffce3bc447d9084f9b96.600x338.jpg?t=1747275549"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/793f096a0059ebfed2d2fc51352aabeb07f677f9/ss_793f096a0059ebfed2d2fc51352aabeb07f677f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747275549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/793f096a0059ebfed2d2fc51352aabeb07f677f9/ss_793f096a0059ebfed2d2fc51352aabeb07f677f9.600x338.jpg?t=1747275549"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/540b6a2c2bdcb2f60e1f6f6925764950dfeb726c/ss_540b6a2c2bdcb2f60e1f6f6925764950dfeb726c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747275549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987110/540b6a2c2bdcb2f60e1f6f6925764950dfeb726c/ss_540b6a2c2bdcb2f60e1f6f6925764950dfeb726c.600x338.jpg?t=1747275549"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.stea